{"id": "240b5c39-71fc-49f5-8acd-eb1730e7854c", "slug": "brand-landing-page", "title": "Brand Landing Page", "description": "Brand Building Hero Section is designed for introducing a product with clear above-the-fold messaging. Key features include headline hierarchy, supporting copy, and a primary call-to-action. It is suitable for homepage hero areas and campaign landing pages.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Brand Landing Page\"\ndescription: \"Brand Building Hero Section is designed for introducing a product with clear above-the-fold messaging. Key features include headline hierarchy, supporting copy, and a primary call-to-action. It is suitable for homepage hero areas and campaign landing pages.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#00B4D8\"\n  secondary: \"#C77DFF\"\n  accent: \"#C77DFF\"\n  background: \"#030303\"\n  surface: \"#1A1A1A\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#2A2A2A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Plus Jakarta Sans\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Plus Jakarta Sans\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Brand Landing Page\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Sourany Phomhome (@sou). Views: 5; favorites: 1; remixes: 0.\nTags: hero, section, animated, threejs, cta, effect.\n## Overview\nBrand Building Hero Section is designed for introducing a product with clear above-the-fold messaging. Key features include headline hierarchy, supporting copy, and a primary call-to-action. It is suitable for homepage hero areas and campaign landing pages.\n\n');\"> Home Cases Library Resources Let's Talk We`re Building Cool Experiences AI \\ WEB3 \\ UI \\ 3D \\ MOTION Crafting Awesome Stories and Killer Designs to Make Brand Stand Out Contact Us Get Sarted\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: We`re Building Cool Experiences.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #00B4D8, secondary #C77DFF, accent #C77DFF, background #030303, surface #1A1A1A, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Plus Jakarta Sans for display moments and Plus Jakarta Sans for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Brand Landing Page</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <script>\n        tailwind.config = {\n            theme: {\n                extend: {\n                    fontFamily: {\n                        sans: ['\"Plus Jakarta Sans\"', 'sans-serif'],\n                    },\n                    colors: {\n                        brand: {\n                            cyan: '#00B4D8',\n                            purple: '#C77DFF',\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    </script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#030303] text-white font-sans overflow-hidden h-screen w-screen relative selection:bg-brand-cyan selection:text-black flex flex-col justify-between\"\n      style=\"background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, #111116 0%, #030303 70%);\">\n\n    <!-- Subtle Grid Background Pattern -->\n    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none opacity-30 mix-blend-screen\"\n         style=\"background-image: url('data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg width=\\\"60\\\" height=\\\"60\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 60 60\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\"><g stroke=\\\"%23333\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\"><path d=\\\"M28,28 L32,32 M32,28 L28,32\\\"/></g></svg>');\">\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Scattered Colored Crosses -->\n    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none opacity-40\">\n        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:add-linear\" class=\"absolute top-[15%] left-[30%] text-brand-purple text-[8px]\"></iconify-icon>\n        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:add-linear\" class=\"absolute top-[25%] left-[45%] text-brand-cyan text-[10px]\"></iconify-icon>\n        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:add-linear\" class=\"absolute top-[60%] right-[25%] text-brand-cyan text-[8px]\"></iconify-icon>\n        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:add-linear\" class=\"absolute top-[75%] left-[20%] text-brand-purple text-[10px]\"></iconify-icon>\n        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:add-linear\" class=\"absolute top-[40%] right-[15%] text-gray-500 text-[12px]\"></iconify-icon>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Main Content Wrapper -->\n    <div class=\"relative z-10 w-full h-full flex flex-col justify-between p-6 md:p-10 max-w-[1600px] mx-auto\">\n\n        <!-- Header Navigation -->\n        <header class=\"flex justify-between items-center w-full\">\n            <nav class=\"hidden md:flex gap-10 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-neutral-400 font-light\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300\">Home</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300\">Cases</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300\">Library</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300\">Resources</a>\n            </nav>\n\n            <!-- Mobile Menu Placeholder -->\n            <div class=\"md:hidden flex items-center\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:hamburger-menu-linear\" class=\"text-2xl text-neutral-400\"></iconify-icon>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                <button class=\"px-6 py-2.5 rounded-[2rem] border border-neutral-800 text-xs tracking-wide hover:bg-neutral-900 transition-colors duration-300\">\n                    Let's Talk\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full border border-neutral-800 flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-neutral-900 transition-colors duration-300\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:restart-linear\" class=\"text-lg text-neutral-400\"></iconify-icon>\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full border border-neutral-800 flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-neutral-900 transition-colors duration-300\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:maximize-linear\" class=\"text-lg text-neutral-400\"></iconify-icon>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- Center 3D Graphic -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center pointer-events-none z-0 overflow-hidden\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"-200 -120 400 340\" class=\"w-full max-w-[800px] h-auto drop-shadow-2xl\">\n                <defs>\n                    <!-- Vibrant Gradient for Underglow -->\n                    <linearGradient id=\"glowPlane\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"0%\">\n                        <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#00B4D8\"/>\n                        <stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#4361EE\"/>\n                        <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#C77DFF\"/>\n                    </linearGradient>\n\n                    <!-- Single Isometric Cube Definition -->\n                    <g id=\"iso-cube\">\n                        <!-- Top Face -->\n                        <path d=\"M0 -20 L35 0 L0 20 L-35 0 Z\" fill=\"#1A1A1A\" stroke=\"#2A2A2A\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/>\n                        <!-- Left Face -->\n                        <path d=\"M-35 0 L0 20 L0 60 L-35 40 Z\" fill=\"#0D0D0D\" stroke=\"#1A1A1A\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/>\n                        <!-- Right Face -->\n                        <path d=\"M0 20 L35 0 L35 40 L0 60 Z\" fill=\"#050505\" stroke=\"#151515\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/>\n                    </g>\n\n                    <filter id=\"blurGlow\" x=\"-20%\" y=\"-20%\" width=\"140%\" height=\"140%\">\n                        <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\"15\" result=\"blur\" />\n                    </filter>\n                </defs>\n\n                <!-- Glowing Base Plane behind cubes -->\n                <polygon points=\"0,-15 150,75 0,165 -150,75\" fill=\"url(#glowPlane)\" filter=\"url(#blurGlow)\" opacity=\"0.8\" />\n                <polygon points=\"0,-5 140,75 0,155 -140,75\" fill=\"url(#glowPlane)\" />\n\n                <!-- Group holding all cubes, scaled to reveal grid gaps forming glowing lines -->\n                <g id=\"cube-grid\">\n                    <!-- Javascript will populate and animate this grid to keep HTML clean and avoid style tags -->\n                </g>\n            </svg>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Bottom Content Area -->\n        <div class=\"z-10 flex flex-col lg:flex-row justify-between items-start lg:items-end w-full gap-10 lg:gap-4 mb-4\">\n\n            <!-- Left Text block -->\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-6 lg:gap-10\">\n                <h1 class=\"text-[3.5rem] leading-[1.05] sm:text-7xl md:text-[5.5rem] lg:text-[7rem] md:leading-[0.95] tracking-tighter font-medium text-white\"\n                    style=\"text-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(255,255,255,0.4), 0 0 100px rgba(255,255,255,0.2);\">\n                    We`re Building<br>Cool Experiences\n                </h1>\n                <div class=\"text-[10px] sm:text-xs tracking-[0.35em] text-neutral-400 uppercase font-light flex gap-4 whitespace-nowrap\">\n                    <span>AI</span> <span class=\"text-neutral-600\">\\</span>\n                    <span>WEB3</span> <span class=\"text-neutral-600\">\\</span>\n                    <span>UI</span> <span class=\"text-neutral-600\">\\</span>\n                    <span>3D</span> <span class=\"text-neutral-600\">\\</span>\n                    <span>MOTION</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Right Text & Buttons block -->\n            <div class=\"max-w-sm flex flex-col items-start lg:items-end text-left lg:text-right\">\n                <p class=\"text-neutral-400 text-sm mb-8 leading-relaxed font-light\">\n                    Crafting Awesome Stories and Killer Designs to Make Brand Stand Out\n                </p>\n                <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-4 w-full lg:w-auto lg:justify-end\">\n                    <button class=\"px-7 py-3 rounded-[2rem] border border-neutral-700 text-xs font-medium hover:bg-neutral-900 transition-colors duration-300\">\n                        Contact Us\n                    </button>\n                    <button class=\"pl-7 pr-1.5 py-1.5 rounded-[2rem] border border-neutral-700 flex items-center gap-4 hover:bg-neutral-900 transition-colors duration-300 group\">\n                        <span class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-wide\">Get Sarted</span>\n                        <div class=\"bg-[#00B4D8] w-9 h-9 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-black group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:add-linear\" class=\"text-xl\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Inline Script to generate grid and apply subtle motion (satisfying floating/motion request without style tags) -->\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n            const gridContainer = document.getElementById('cube-grid');\n            const cubes = [];\n\n            // Generate 4x4 isometric diamond grid\n            for(let col = 0; col < 4; col++) {\n                for(let row = 0; row < 4; row++) {\n                    const x = (col - row) * 35;\n                    const y = (col + row) * 20;\n\n                    const wrapper = document.createElementNS(\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\", \"g\");\n                    wrapper.setAttribute(\"transform\", `translate(${x}, ${y})`);\n\n                    const inner = document.createElementNS(\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\", \"g\");\n                    // Scale down slightly to create gaps where the glowing plane shows through\n                    inner.setAttribute(\"style\", \"transform: scale(0.88); transform-origin: 0 20px;\");\n\n                    const useEl = document.createElementNS(\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\", \"use\");\n                    useEl.setAttribute(\"href\", \"#iso-cube\");\n\n                    inner.appendChild(useEl);\n                    wrapper.appendChild(inner);\n                    gridContainer.appendChild(wrapper);\n\n                    // Store inner group for animation with a staggered phase based on grid position\n                    cubes.push({ el: inner, phase: (col + row) * 0.5 });\n                }\n            }\n\n            // Subtle floating animation loop\n            let time = 0;\n            function animate() {\n                time += 0.015;\n                cubes.forEach(cube => {\n                    // Calculate gentle vertical float\n                    const yOffset = Math.sin(time + cube.phase) * 4;\n                    // Apply translation on top of the scaling\n                    cube.el.style.transform = `scale(0.88) translateY(${yOffset}px)`;\n                });\n                requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n            }\n            animate();\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "brand-landing-page.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/brand-landing-page.jpg", "source_name": "brand-landing-page-DESIGN.md", "views": 221, "forks": 5, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "8bd0314a-9525-4a13-996e-2c37cbd9e514", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T17:39:02.413448+00:00"}